// attrib: Marsivane (named-arcanist possessive dropped per the sheet's own
// coined_from note: "Maximilian's Earthen Grasp" -> "Earthen Grasp").
// No `Restrained`/`Grappled` `BuffKind` exists -- `Rooted` ("Reduces
// movement speed to 0") is the nearest available primitive for "seized and
// held in place". The sheet's "crushes for bludgeoning each turn while
// held" rider (repeat damage every round the grapple holds) has no
// per-tick-while-buffed damage primitive to hook into here; this ships as a
// single bludgeoning hit on the initial grasp instead, same "one primitive,
// one deviation, documented" idiom as this batch's other spells.
// energy_cost priced above this batch's CC-only `earthbind.ron` (30) and the
// level-1 `hollow/ray_of_sickness.ron` (30, weaker Sickened rider) since this
// spell stacks real damage on top of a full `Rooted` lockdown -- damage+CC
// for less than either a CC-only or damage-only sibling would be a pricing
// inversion.
BasicRanged(
    energy_cost: 35,
    buildup_duration: 0.35,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 17,
            buff: Some((
                kind: Rooted,
                dur_secs: 10.0,
                strength: Value(1.5),
                chance: 1.0,
            )),
            damage_kind: Bludgeoning,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 55.0,
    num_projectiles: Value(1),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 2 spell -> min_level 12, same `level * 6` convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(12)),
    ),
)
